            <li id="ref-6"><span>[6]</span> Lange and Santarius: digitalisation and rebound effects; complete publication details.</li>
            <li id="ref-7"><span>[7]</span> Add source for human-centred design / accessibility claims.</li>
            <li id="ref-8"><span>[8]</span> Cardullo and Kitchin: smart-city participation; complete publication details.</li>
