              <p class="slide-subtitle">A critical evaluation through the social-ecological-technological systems (SETS) framework.</p>
              <div class="question-callout">
                <span>CENTRAL ANALYTICAL QUESTION</span>
                <p>To what extent does PDD translate its smart and ecological ambitions into meaningful environmental, social and governance outcomes?</p>
              </div>
              <p class="cover-topic-line">ECOLOGICAL SUSTAINABILITY · SMART CITY 2.0 · GOVERNANCE &amp; JUSTICE</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="presentation-slide" data-view="2" data-presenter="PRESENTER 1 · Teo Li Tien" hidden>
