              <div class="ecology-analysis">
                <section class="ecology-impact" aria-labelledby="ecology-gas-title" data-reveal-step="1">
                  <h3 id="ecology-gas-title">🔥 Reliance on Natural Gas</h3>
                  <ul>
                    <li><span class="ecology-impact-icon ecology-impact-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Reduces emissions</li>
                    <li><span class="ecology-impact-icon ecology-impact-cross" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>But does not eliminate</li>
                  </ul>
                </section>

                <section class="ecology-impact" aria-labelledby="ecology-waste-title" data-reveal-step="1">
                  <h3 id="ecology-waste-title">🗑️ Pneumatic Waste Collection</h3>
                  <ul>
                    <li><span class="ecology-impact-icon ecology-impact-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Reduces collection traffic</li>
                    <li><span class="ecology-impact-icon ecology-impact-cross" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>But does not prevent waste generation</li>
                  </ul>
                </section>
              </div>

              <p class="ecology-takeaway" data-reveal-step="2">An Efficiency-Oriented Approach → Eco for whom?</p>
              <footer class="ecology-footer" data-reveal-step="2">
                <p>PDD remains under development; incomplete operational evidence may reflect timing.</p>
                <p>Sources: Energy Market Authority (2026) · JTC Corporation (2024) · McPhearson et al. (2022) · Meadows (2008) · Ramboll (2026)</p>
              </footer>
