              <section class="sets-evaluation-panels" aria-label="Critical finding and counterargument">
                <article data-reveal-step="5">
                  <span>OUR CRITICAL FINDING</span>
                  <p>Technological performance is more explicitly quantified than wider ecological and social outcomes in available documentation.</p>
                </article>
                <article data-reveal-step="6">
                  <span>IMPORTANT COUNTERARGUMENT</span>
                  <p>State-led coordination enables delivery; incomplete evidence may reflect ongoing development.</p>
                </article>
              </section>

              <p class="sets-evaluation-takeaway" data-reveal-step="7">PDD's technological integration is evident, but comprehensive sustainability remains to be demonstrated.</p>
              <footer class="sets-evaluation-citations">
                <span>Our reading of available project documentation <a href="#ref-1">[1]</a> <a href="#ref-3">[3]</a> · SETS <a href="#ref-2">[2]</a></span>
