          <article class="presentation-slide conclusion-slide" data-view="11" data-presenter="PRESENTER 1 · Teo Li Tien" hidden>
            <div class="slide-overline"><span>CCS5209 · URBAN SUSTAINABILITY FUTURES</span><span>11 / RECOMMENDATIONS + CONCLUSION</span></div>
            <span class="cover-brand-logo" role="img" aria-label="National University of Singapore">
              <img src="assets/NUS-logo-trimmed.jpg" alt="NUS" />
            </span>
            <div class="slide-content view-eleven-content">
              <p class="slide-kicker">RECOMMENDATIONS · CONCLUSION</p>
              <h2>From Smart Ambitions to <em>Sustainable Outcomes.</em></h2>
              <div class="conclusion-recommendations">
                <div data-reveal-step="1"><span>01</span><p><strong><svg class="refinement-icon heading-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M39 8C22 8 10 13 9 26c0 8 6 13 13 12C35 36 39 21 39 8Z M10 40c7-10 13-15 23-22"/></svg>Environmental</strong><small>Publish baselines and biodiversity indicators.</small></p></div>
                <div data-reveal-step="2"><span>02</span><p><strong><svg class="refinement-icon heading-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="12" y="12" width="24" height="24" rx="4"/><path d="M18 18h12v12H18zM18 4v8m12-8v8M18 36v8m12-8v8M4 18h8m-8 12h8m24-12h8m-8 12h8"/></svg>Technological</strong><small>Assess digital footprints against efficiency gains.</small></p></div>
                <div data-reveal-step="3"><span>03</span><p><strong><svg class="refinement-icon heading-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="13" r="6"/><circle cx="10" cy="20" r="4"/><circle cx="38" cy="20" r="4"/><path d="M12 40v-5c0-7 5-12 12-12s12 5 12 12v5H12Z"/></svg>Social</strong><small>Measure well-being, accessibility and opportunities.</small></p></div>
                <div data-reveal-step="4"><span>04</span><p><strong><svg class="refinement-icon heading-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 6v34M10 12h28M14 12 6 28h16L14 12Zm20 0-8 16h16l-8-16ZM16 41h16"/></svg>Governance</strong><small>Strengthen transparency, review and participation.</small></p></div>
              </div>
              <p class="view-eleven-supporting" data-reveal-step="5">PDD’s broader sustainability contribution remains promising but conditional.</p>
              <p class="view-eleven-judgement" data-reveal-step="6">Sustainability must be demonstrated, not assumed.</p>
              <footer class="view-eleven-footer" data-reveal-step="6">Recommendations: Group's own proposals based on the evaluation.</footer>
              <div class="slide-reveal-controls" data-reveal-controls data-reveal-total="6" aria-label="View 11 reveal controls">
                <span class="slide-reveal-progress" data-reveal-progress aria-live="polite">Step 0 of 6</span>
                <div>
                  <button type="button" data-reveal-next aria-label="Reveal next step"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 5v14l11-7zM19 5v14" /></svg></button>
                  <button type="button" data-reveal-all aria-label="Reveal all"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7S2 12 2 12Z" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" /></svg></button>
                  <button type="button" data-reveal-reset aria-label="Reset reveals"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 11a9 9 0 1 1 2.6 6.4M3 4v7h7" /></svg></button>
